  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed front dormer extension, by virtue of overall size, siting and design, would appear incongruous, insubordinate and out of character with the host property, surrounding area and street scene, contrary to National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policy D3 of The London Plan (2021) and Policy GR1 of The Harrow Local Plan (2021-2041).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;In the absence of a Reasonable Exception Statement, it has not been demonstrated that the proposal would satisfactorily address fire safety, contrary to National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policy D12 A of the London Plan (2021) and Policy GR3B of The Harrow Local Plan (2021-2041).&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
